                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bd82fcde-9fca-3513-ad6a-0970ce4ded7b",
                        "entry_id": "f91c9e00-dce2-32d2-924b-92c8e70df54a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "коллективный принцип в трудовой деятельности, общественной жизни"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1f6e9f2-c9a3-4278-999f-bb64895fabcb",
                                "sense_id": "bd82fcde-9fca-3513-ad6a-0970ce4ded7b",
                                "text": "Это я к тому, что все мы индивидуалисты, несмотря на многочисленные попытки привить дух коллективизма и чувство плеча."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c154edbd-e842-4754-8090-398e47f9ff50",
                        "source_entry_id": "f91c9e00-dce2-32d2-924b-92c8e70df54a",
                        "source_sense_id": "bd82fcde-9fca-3513-ad6a-0970ce4ded7b",
                        "target_lang_word": "collectivism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "collectivism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d48da45c-e64d-3aa6-843e-c9fe407ebdf8",
                                        "entry_id": "e59153c3-c06e-3b57-9696-30687ca81c06",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An economic system in which the means of production and distribution are owned and controlled by the people collectively"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92a00999-86b2-3fcf-88dd-01de6a3bc2b8",
                                        "entry_id": "e59153c3-c06e-3b57-9696-30687ca81c06",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The practice or principle of giving a group priority over each individual in it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c6ca7bd5-225a-4cff-8ac9-c3b94834cc44",
                        "source_entry_id": "f91c9e00-dce2-32d2-924b-92c8e70df54a",
                        "source_sense_id": "bd82fcde-9fca-3513-ad6a-0970ce4ded7b",
                        "target_lang_word": "colectivismo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "colectivismo",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9af51f8-5446-32f9-b9fb-b1b210ec8494",
                                        "entry_id": "03a5a32d-4920-3021-9df5-2538e84e71b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Doctrina que prioriza los intereses colectivos y la igualdad por sobre las libertades individuales."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Política"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60814b5a-16d4-48f9-81f5-51d3a337540c",
                                                "sense_id": "d9af51f8-5446-32f9-b9fb-b1b210ec8494",
                                                "text": "Motivados algunos por el deseo biempensante de ayudar al prójimo, y otros por el deseo de pertenecer a una casta privilegiada, los principales líderes del mundo occidental han abandonado el modelo de la libertad por distintas versiones de lo que llamamos colectivismo."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e6d5e9f-8cc3-49d8-b5da-954ed605cdaf",
                        "source_entry_id": "f91c9e00-dce2-32d2-924b-92c8e70df54a",
                        "source_sense_id": "bd82fcde-9fca-3513-ad6a-0970ce4ded7b",
                        "target_lang_word": "collettivismo",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "collettivismo",
                                "target_lang_code": "it",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50329af4-4620-3f77-92fe-643b41be73b6",
                                        "entry_id": "40c1896b-77cc-3971-a038-643df8c6ca8a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "visione morale, politica, economica e sociale che esalta la dipendenza reciproca di ogni individuo e la priorità delle esigenze di gruppo su quelle personali"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "diritto"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ab6bb377-d599-4dff-abcd-992efc7a0510",
                        "source_entry_id": "f91c9e00-dce2-32d2-924b-92c8e70df54a",
                        "source_sense_id": "bd82fcde-9fca-3513-ad6a-0970ce4ded7b",
                        "target_lang_word": "Kollektivismus",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b39ee2b8-e7a4-433a-b9f3-19520c8651ef",
                        "source_entry_id": "f91c9e00-dce2-32d2-924b-92c8e70df54a",
                        "source_sense_id": "bd82fcde-9fca-3513-ad6a-0970ce4ded7b",
                        "target_lang_word": "collectivisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "collectivisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62b6ab96-abb3-30d8-97e3-7e9f69516fa7",
                                        "entry_id": "c3df3f13-e7be-3b89-b7e8-e76f76bbc1af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Théorie sociale qui consiste à supprimer la propriété individuelle des moyens de production, et à remettre à la collectivité des travailleurs tous les produits du travail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41105e01-44a8-4866-b782-cf0d935d565c",
                                                "sense_id": "62b6ab96-abb3-30d8-97e3-7e9f69516fa7",
                                                "text": "Puis, à propos de Mège et de son discours, prononcé l’après-midi à la Chambre, il fit amèrement le procès du collectivisme, qu’il déclarait être une des formes démocratiques du despotisme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b316d3d-e452-4182-9ab5-19330dff5a70",
                                                "sense_id": "62b6ab96-abb3-30d8-97e3-7e9f69516fa7",
                                                "text": "Il leur faut des électeurs ouvriers assez naïfs pour se laisser duper par des phrases ronflantes sur le collectivisme futur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d7e87fd-2f04-4a10-95f0-052f6bef9b38",
                                                "sense_id": "62b6ab96-abb3-30d8-97e3-7e9f69516fa7",
                                                "text": "Une jolie clameur dans la presse et au Parlement ! Un socialiste au gouvernement et quel socialiste ? Un socialiste identifiant en un discours prononcé quelques années plus tôt à Saint-Mandé socialisme et collectivisme !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1ce358e-043e-48b6-9b47-ed275aaa90db",
                                                "sense_id": "62b6ab96-abb3-30d8-97e3-7e9f69516fa7",
                                                "text": "Il est paradoxal de voir à quel point les grands bourgeois, partisans de l’individualisme théorique, adoptent pour eux-mêmes un collectivisme pratique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
